---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import ServerlessCostCalculator from '../../components/ServerlessCostCalculator.jsx';
---
<ToolLayout title="Serverless Function Cost Calculator" description="Estimate monthly serverless (Lambda-style) cost from request volume, duration, and memory allocation.">
  <ServerlessCostCalculator client:load slot="tool" />
  <h2>Why memory allocation affects cost more than you'd think</h2>
  <p>Serverless billing multiplies duration by allocated memory, not just execution time — over-provisioning memory "just in case" directly increases your bill even if the function doesn't need it.</p>

  <h2>Common mistakes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Over-allocating memory "to be safe"</strong> without profiling actual usage, unnecessarily inflating cost since billing scales with memory allocated, not used.</li>
    <li><strong>Ignoring cold start impact on effective duration</strong>, especially for latency-sensitive functions with infrequent invocations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Use cases</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Estimating monthly cost before deploying a new serverless function</li>
    <li>Comparing cost impact of different memory allocation settings</li>
    <li>Budgeting for a serverless architecture before committing to it</li>
  </ul>
</ToolLayout>
